			"Search the Overworld for Sister Ysra Vale's own building."
			""
			"Ysra studied the willing personal offering needed to bind captured power to a bearer. Restore her sanctuary and learn why friends can help with LP while each person must make their own final sacrifice."
			""
			"Use a Quest Scroll to speak with Sister Ysra Vale. Complete this NPC's 7 deliveries in Quest Giver; this FTB quest tracks the final personal completion advancement."
			"Give the requested materials to the named NPC one at a time. Each accepted delivery repairs part of that nearby building. A player-placed block at a repair site is preserved."
			""
			"Deliveries, in order:"
			"1. Stone Beneath the Shelter: 16 Stone Bricks."
			"2. Shelter Before Sermons: 16 Birch Planks."
			"3. Light Without Exposure: 8 Glass."
			"4. A Place to Recover: 8 White Wool."
			"5. Something Living: 8 Poppy."
			"6. The Names We Tend: 12 Paper."
			"7. What We Give Freely: 4 Lantern."
			""
			"Each storyline is one-time per player across every copy of that NPC. Finding another building does not restart it. If you change buildings midway, earlier repairs do not move to the new copy."
